#### alignment code ####
1) align_color_thermal_boxes.py - draw boxes around leaves in color + thermal images to create data for calibration step
2) estimate_mapping_from_boxes.py - create and modify the calibration file based on the boxes from the alignment step
3) view_box_overlay.py - visualize the resulting boxes

#### Datasets ####
1) merge_datasets.py - tool for merging two sets of labeled bounding boxes (e.g. roboflow_boxes + SAM3 annotations)
2) propagate_boxes.py - tool for tracking bounding boxes between adjacent frames to increase data

#### Probes ####
1) multispectral_detection_loader.py - multispectral data loader used for the linear + nn probes
2) linear_probe_multi_v2.py - logistic regression based probe that tests vs leaf dataset
3) leaf_nn_classifier.py - nn based probe that tests vs leaf dataset

python leaf_nn_classifier.py 
        --train-samples "/data3/datasets/shady_lanes_10_10_25/scripts/SAM3_baseline/grape_diseases.train_with_tracking.txt" 
        --eval-samples "/data3/datasets/shady_lanes_10_10_25/scripts/SAM3_baseline/grape_diseases.test.txt" 
        --calibration "/data3/datasets/shady_lanes_10_10_25/scripts/thermal_color_matches_calib.json" 
        --positive-classes esca 
        --negative-classes "healthy leaf" "unhealthy leaf" 
        --modalities color --unfreeze "1" 
        --results "probe_results/single.csv" > "probe_results//esca__color.txt"